{
  "_comment": "security-baseline-classification (board SkGebruik). An organisation classifies each application it uses on availability, integrity and confidentiality (BIO baseline levels BBN1 to BBN3), with a reason each. bbnLevel is the highest of the three, set by UsageClassificationSubscriber on every save. Every property carries the owning-organisation read and update rule usage.interneAnnotation uses, so a supplier that may read the usage of its product does not see the classification.",
